<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Philip Morris.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Philip Morris.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued seven million American-style call warrants, on Philip Morris, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Bank said.</p>
<p>Five warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    70.00 CHF		 PREMIUM	27.05 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.55 CHF		  GEARING	8.13 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 06.MAY.97-15.JAN.99   PAYDATE	05.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  61.75 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES	     </p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
